    "Clean Architecture (Domain / Application / Infrastructure / UI / Api layers)",
    "Minimal API endpoints for auth (POST /api/auth/login, POST /api/auth/logout)",
    "Entity Framework Core with SQLite persistence",
    "Auto-seeded admin user in development via AdminUserSeeder",
    "Protected /admin panel with cascading authentication state",
    "Database migrations managed with dotnet-ef"
